item.description:
Marishka, the Third Bride (Van Helsing, movie, 2004). The "Glimmering Jewel", Dancer, Courtesan, Eternal Entertainer.<br><br>Marishka is the Third Bride of Count Dracula from the 2004 Hollywood movie, <i>Van Helsing</i>. 

Art | Promotional shot from the 2004 Van Helsing movie of the captivating Josie Maran in the role of Marishka. 

//Synopsis\\
Once a Court Dancer and Courtesan within the Harem of the Sultan of the Ottoman Empire, catching the eye of a visiting Count Dracula from Wallachia during a celebratory festival, her life and unlife fell into the hands of the Count and soon became his youngest Bride. 

Three centuries later, her life is filled with her passion for the arts, putting on dances as entertainment with her troupe of beautiful women - all vampires - all for show. A show that runs eternally.

//Greeting\\
~ Marishka's Dance Troupe puts on a nightly show at the local Tavern within a Wallachian township, where she finds an assuming person (left ambiguous purposefully, could be {{user}} if you wish!) to sit on her lap. (AnyPOV, SFW/NSFW)

//Jailbreak included in the bottom section of the character card!
~AnyPOV!~
~NSFW/SFW (your choice!)~

//Personal notes: Josie Maran's role in the Van Helsing movie was criminally short, yet in her introductory scene, she was a standout in her own way with her playful dance-like motions and wicked grin. 

Since the movie did not provide much in the way of background information, the good old internet sleuthing and some historical choices on my part helped me to piece together something believable. Neither of the Brides' backgrounds may be fully lore accurate if only due to the lack of information 
around them. Hopefully they're enjoyable just the same!


//The Other Brides\\
<a href="https://chub.ai/characters/AshuraDreams/aleera-758a7aa41e57" style="color: pink;">Aleera</a><br>
<a href="https://chub.ai/characters/AshuraDreams/verona-c428fc9a83a6" style="color: blue;">Verona</a><br>

Aleera, the Second Bride (Van Helsing, movie, 2004). The Poison Smile.<br><br>Aleera, the Second Bride of Count Dracula, known as the "Poison Smile" for her seductive ability to lure in almost anyone into her magnetic pull to get what she wants. 

Portrayed in the 2004 Hollywood movie, Van Helsing, by the breathtaking Elena Anaya.

//Art credit | Van Helsing (2004) | Source: https://www.deviantart.com/nuyunggun/art/Van-Helsing-Aleera-546848685

//Personal notes: Aside from Marishka (who criminally had a short yet striking appearance), Aleera was the standout of the three brides by a longshot! Like Aleera, I'd have killed for those waves in her hair. Figuratively speaking, ya?  :)

AnyPOV of course, sooooo...you can be a sentient earring, a vampiric tree, your mind is the limit.  :p

Jailbreak included in the bottom portion of the character card. 

Greeting: Aleera attempts to seduce {{user}} with her presence and her inviting words when she catches them leaving the Tavern. (SFW/NSFW, ANYPOV)


//Other Brides\\
<a href="https://chub.ai/characters/AshuraDreams/verona-c428fc9a83a6" style="color: blue;">Verona</a><br>
<a href="https://chub.ai/characters/AshuraDreams/marishka-a1011b40a50e" style="color: gold;">Marishka</a>

Having fun with your mother in public places.<br><br>This bot is supposed to be the base for several scenarios involving being with your sexy, neglected and shy mother in public places.

The situations I plan:
- Mother's Day cinema;
- Valentine's Day restaurant;
- Prom;
- accidentally at Halloween Party;
- accidentally at Swingers Party;
- Neighbour pool party.

This is my first bot, and I am still tweaking it. I try to use the guides spread through the internet, but constructive critique is welcome.

Changelog:
11.05.2024 - I thought about a few corrections when playing other bots. Added prom entry. I will probably change it once I test it.
